# SHUTTERBUG: a foe fixed to rock (here a spout under the pillar in the
# prologue) drops off when photographed, dies when it lands, and kills
# what it lands on.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat goto 600
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat dummy 3 116 60 8
cheat dummy 6 116 84 0
cheat pos 10 40
press A
expect falling == 1
wait 40
expect foes_3 == 0
expect foes_6 == 0
expect score == 800
